"إلا عندما ينظر أحد::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:91
msgid ""
"The ``controls_channel.py`` example under File → Examples → ``12-Protocol`` "
"uses exactly this shape to expose a FLIR Lepton's measurement mode, "
